        -464,
        -176
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Summarize unpaid freee invoices with Gemini and notify Slack, Sheets, and Gmail\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs every day at 9 AM, loads configuration values, and retrieves unsettled invoices from freee. It ranks unpaid invoices by overdue priority, sends the prepared prompt to Gemini to generate a prioritized summary, then records and distributes the result. The summary is logged to Google Sheets, posted to Slack, and emailed to the accounting contact via Gmail.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the schedule trigger for the desired timezone and 9 AM run time.\n- Set the required values in the Config node, such as the freee company or query parameters, Slack webhook URL, recipient email, and any spreadsheet identifiers.\n- Add valid credentials or authentication headers for the freee API HTTP request.\n- Connect Google Gemini credentials and confirm the prompt/model settings are appropriate for invoice summarization.\n- Connect Google Sheets and Gmail credentials, then verify the target sheet, Slack channel webhook, and email recipient.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the overdue ranking logic, Gemini prompt, Slack message format, sheet columns, or email content to match internal accounting priorities and escalation rules."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
